🔐 Digital Privacy Intelligence Dashboard
📌 Overview

This project demonstrates how AI can be used to analyze and visualize a person's digital footprint, privacy risks, and online exposure. Using Claude, I created a Privacy Intelligence Dashboard that identifies potential privacy concerns and provides actionable recommendations for improving digital security.

🎯 Objective

Build an AI-powered dashboard that:

Analyzes digital footprint exposure
Identifies privacy vulnerabilities
Assesses online security risks
Generates privacy improvement recommendations
Presents findings in a structured dashboard format 

  
🛠️ Features
Digital Footprint Analysis
Social media exposure assessment
Public information visibility review
Online presence evaluation
Privacy Risk Detection
Weak privacy settings identification
Data exposure analysis
Account security assessment
Security Recommendations
Privacy enhancement suggestions
Account protection strategies
Digital hygiene best practices
Dashboard Visualization
Privacy score overview
Risk level indicators
Actionable improvement roadmap

  
📊 Dashboard Components
Privacy Score
Exposure Level Analysis
Security Risk Assessment
Account Protection Checklist
Improvement Recommendations
Priority Action Items

  
🤖 AI Workflow
Collect digital presence information.
Analyze privacy exposure across platforms.
Identify potential vulnerabilities.
Calculate privacy risk levels.
Generate security recommendations.
Visualize findings in dashboard format.

  
🚀 Outcome

This project demonstrates how AI can assist in digital privacy management by transforming scattered online information into actionable security insights.
